Er an-zú-denken-fing.
]

#par(first-line-indent: (amount: 7em, all: true))[
他手拿着一把佛盘剑：#linebreak()#h(8em)他早就要找那个蛮松蟒——#linebreak()#h(7em)他就躲在一棵屯屯树后面，#linebreak()#h(7em)就站得那儿心里头想。
]

#par(first-line-indent: (amount: 0em, all: true))[
And, as in uffish thought he stood,#linebreak()#h(0em)The Jabberwock, with eyes of flame,#linebreak()#h(0em)Came whiffling through the tulgey wood,#linebreak()#h(0em)And burbled as it came!
]

#par(first-line-indent: (amount: 2.5em, all: true))[
Pendant qu’il pense, tout uffusé,#linebreak()#h(2.5em)Le Jaseroque, à l’oeil flambeant,#linebreak()#h(2.5em)Vient siblant par le bois tullegeais,#linebreak()#h(2.5em)Et burbule en venant.
]

#par(first-line-indent: (amount: 5em, all: true))[
Als stand er tief in Andacht auf,#linebreak()#h(5em)Des Jammerwocben’s Augen-feuer#linebreak()#h(5em)Durch turgen Wald mit Wiffek kam#linebreak()#h(5em)Ein burbelnd Ungeheuer!
]

#par(first-line-indent: (amount: 7.5em, all: true))[
他正在那儿想的个鸟飞飞，#linebreak()#h(7.5em)那炸脖甪，两个灯笼的眼，#linebreak()#h(7.5em)且秃儿巧林子里夫雷雷#linebreak()#h(7.5em)又渤波儿波儿的出来撵。
]

